WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.520
Festival Torah readings follow the correct day

00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:03.240
and location.

00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:05.240
Keep the local calendar visible.

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:07.740
A well-placed queue makes accuracy easier

00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:08.740
during a busy week.
